        "cues": [
          {
            "text": "For a production batch, choose Enrollment in the sidebar.",
            "source_start": 0,
            "source_end": 2.832,
            "start": 0,
            "duration": 3.8,
            "speech_start": 0.2,
            "speech_end": 3.2933333333333334
          },
          {
            "text": "First, create a batch policy: how many devices may enroll, and for how long.",
            "source_start": 2.832,
            "source_end": 12.119,
            "start": 3.8,
            "duration": 9.32,
            "speech_start": 4.0,
            "speech_end": 8.906666666666666
          },
          {
            "text": "Next, reserve names and serial numbers: paste a roster CSV and click Check.",
            "source_start": 12.119,
            "source_end": 16.417,
            "start": 13.120000000000001,
            "duration": 5.92,
            "speech_start": 13.32,
            "speech_end": 18.504
          },
          {
            "text": "Download the credentials: the only copy of the claim keys, for your factory provisioning media.",
            "source_start": 16.417,
            "source_end": 18.282,
            "start": 19.04,
            "duration": 6.48,
            "speech_start": 19.24,
            "speech_end": 25.0
          },
          {
            "text": "Then register the claims in your fleet. Each device then enrolls itself at first boot.",
            "source_start": 18.282,
            "source_end": 29.8,
